alse,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-088-002","sourceId":"b2-088-002","sourceIndex":1,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Six men have been trapped in a mine for seventeen hours.","start":20.442,"end":25.16,"score":0.95,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-088-003","sourceId":"b2-088-003","sourceIndex":2,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"If they are not brought to the surface soon they may lose their lives.","start":26.74,"end":31.19,"score":0.981,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-088-004","sourceId":"b2-088-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,6],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"However, rescue operations are proving difficult.","start":32.44,"end":35.87,"score":0.985,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-088-005","sourceId":"b2-088-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"If explosives are used, vibrations will cause the roof of the mine to collapse.","start":36.81,"end":42.9,"score":0.973,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-088-006","sourceId":"b2-088-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Rescue workers are therefore drilling a hole on the north side of the mine.","start":44.12,"end":50.12,"score":0.966,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-088-007","sourceId":"b2-088-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"They intend to bring the men up in a special capsule.","start":50.92,"end":54.9,"score":0.986,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-088-008","sourceId":"b2-088-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"If there had not been a hard layer of rock beneath the soil, they would have completed the job in a few hours.","start":56.44,"end":64.363,"score":0.974,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-088-009","sourceId":"b2-088-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"As it is, they have been drilling for 16 hours and they still have a long way to go.","start":64.94,"end":71.543,"score":0.963,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-088-010-p01","sourceId":"b2-088-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Meanwhile, a microphone, which was lowered into the mine two hours ago,","start":72.92,"end":78.2,"score":0.965,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-088-010-p02","sourceId":"b2-088-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[12,24],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"has enabled the men to keep in touch with their closest relatives.","start":78.94,"end":82.72,"score":0.99,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-088-011","sourceId":"b2-088-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,21],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Though they are running out of food and drink, the men are cheerful and confident that they will get out soon.","start":84.17,"end":91.4,"score":0.902,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["low-word-confidence"]},{"id":"b2-088-012","sourceId":"b2-088-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"They have been told that rescue operations are progressing smoothly.","start":92.28,"end":96.29,"score":0.987,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-088-013","sourceId":"b2-088-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"If they knew how difficult it was to drill through the hard rock, they would lose heart.","start":97.64,"end":103.59,"score":0.968,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
